                    <p>High-resolution Cloudinary photography presents authentic perspectives without misleading filters.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-3">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-icon-box" style="background-color: var(--c-accent);">
